From 9d8d7cd615c66a1c98e232c952fb3e41550aa6e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shripad621git <shripad62001@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:30:33 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] esp32s31: add i2s nodes and the es8311 audio codec

- Add the i2s0 and i2s1 nodes to the ESP32-S31 devicetree
- Add a playback driver and binding for the Everest ES8311 codec
- Describe the codec, the I2S pins and the NS4150B amplifier enable
  pin on esp32s31_function_coreboard

The audio pins are not in the board user guide. They follow a
third-party configuration tested on this board and still need a
check against the schematic. Build tested only.
